ory agreement and finds it in the fund's best interests, as Section 15(c) requires.\n- **Shareholder notice:** Shareholders receive an information statement generally within 90 days after the new sub-adviser is engaged.\n- **Order conditions:** The fund follows the order's limits, such as caps on affiliated sub-advisers and restrictions on changes in control.\n\n**Principal adviser responsibilities**\n\nThe principal adviser remains fully responsible for:\n\n- Selecting, evaluating, and recommending sub-advisers, with documented due diligence\n- Monitoring sub-adviser performance, risk, and compliance with fund policies\n- Allocating assets and supervising the overall portfolio\n- Providing accurate disclosure and reporting to the board\n- Meeting its fiduciary duty under Section 36(b) and the Advisers Act","ttft_ms":2503,"type":"result","duration_ms":3540,"uuid":"78523a5b-5550-45fe-a896-e0eebb68db38","ttft_stream_ms":722,"time_to_request_ms":57,"first_content_frame_ms":722,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
